{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99db33dd087d5f781c01ca1a1f31da8603bd5958f4ea12d9e356d4a3feaa98ab",
      "text": "伙伴常伴身旁",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d62962d8d44f7b026e6d4221c6cec9b6bf8322da4a31131cee7ebbfff4981e39",
      "text": "F-LAGS收到了音乐游戏宣传视频的\n出演委托。\n在正式拍摄之前，三人兼顾了解音乐游戏，\n决定前往游戏厅去体验一番。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99db33dd087d5f781c01ca1a1f31da8603bd5958f4ea12d9e356d4a3feaa98ab",
      "text": "伙伴常伴身旁",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63c2b7367835aee3ad95b34c44967f9acf9532b1d6ed8fbe60179ac4675274e8",
      "text": "那么就让我来做进一步说明吧。\n请确认这份资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:660da4a6c7a986d1748aac88ea13b7fdf692d82fd50b37fd75321b7e898fd8da",
      "text": "谢谢您！……新作音乐游戏\n的工作，内容是出演宣传视频吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c832f49c147b8a7b979a431a3ad2743865ef5d6ae8b9c50d4daf8c9e0c3fed0",
      "text": "是的。听说是一款准备在游戏厅等场所推出的\n新作音乐游戏，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f375fc38e5caa1d787d3ff39ab08c5d20d1caf92733f2efbc051700bee8da541",
      "text": "对方希望能把相关的宣传推广，\n交给F-LAGS的各位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cb21086a436c88042f967b12f4dc3b2ae2d540fcac964f29f9e6066cc41e52c",
      "text": "嚯。不光是出演宣传视频，游戏里还会\n收录《With...STORY》啊。真厉害啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18f6041a72821d24871325e1eaa37995f574d6189e29cb8c82993b51e22a698b",
      "text": "音游区一直都可热闹了呢。想到俺们的\n歌曲会在那里播放，就觉得兴奋得不行啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e13ceca295d0b8994f80f84566f7f960f067291a80fc192603552b8e16215a14",
      "text": "…说起来，大吾以前经常去\n游戏厅呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bde1b7bacd25c94476a0d0205f7600642d3dd61e77129a4dfeac46ed2d1aa267",
      "text": "…这次看来在很多方面，都要倚仗大吾了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98022abff6ca244afa8d36938013745e3a183ef3d17422d4165d25272512421c",
      "text": "只要是俺能帮上忙的，就包在俺身上！\n再说了，大家一起齐心协力的话肯定没问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:719b8a5c1d8c5675542235262b8df2e6095fa722bfa1f25f7428df98bd4a12a8",
      "text": "嗯，就是这样！\n集合我们三人的力量，好好完成宣传的工作吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21cf3247fe1b3f41099ce15a5308888d73831ec225316eac617f812241f91cf4",
      "text": "各位，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a89ae0e34eb207b3ac8ad526b611607142894f68eee27e1f8d8e18e2f2b3039c",
      "text": "我已经向对方提出了请求，可以在拍摄前试玩。\n如果还有其他不放心的事，请随时来找我商量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d702a8b67bb3041cec58319b8ccced0776d0a9559c118fac2944fa7c2d59bf1",
      "text": "关于这次的游戏，最大的亮点是\n支持两人一起玩的“合作游玩”系统。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce07079bafb6ebc62cf2cc16e3015e2a53e799f45a5a7cfbf1686c4f5332a7bf",
      "text": "…合作游玩，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c4ff64b5ab97c4c6158bf6b53d128e6fe99882435e33fb4b3c6035371af5337",
      "text": "是的。两人一边聆听同一首曲子，一边默契配合\n去点击音符，以此来提高得分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2217c2ee1e488673f72d2c1155e224364e8d615eaafaf7028320d9dbd85000",
      "text": "这是为了让平时不怎么玩游戏的人、以及不擅长\n玩游戏的人也能乐在其中而设计的系统。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ed6742c14a9a1c750d4158f06af73f4531d00bc6251a1c5d4763b8e63915c8",
      "text": "嚯。一提到两个人玩音游，\n我脑海里大半都是对战的形式就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ac145006415836a5af4c5f24a1d1ceeeb9e6479146a3e3bc4df8bbd7378473b",
      "text": "就是说呢。我之前和朋友一起玩的音游也是那样的……\n不过，这个游戏正好相反呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:089d91cb5ed0206ceeaa81ab3069943dcddb842daec5d28dbb6c7486aff73bf5",
      "text": "…互相合作，以高分为目标。\n确实是对初学者很友好的系统呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93348c8577e1dcbd00603255a4b36d17f16b5403e5479a25c4770432b409ea2d",
      "text": "俺们的曲子能被选进这种让大家都绽放\n满分笑容的温柔游戏里，真是太荣幸了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fba5445406c90e74eab030c1897f88e1f09eb38fa4cbf4d0dd60fd34d6c120bf",
      "text": "像这样听您讲完之后，\n越来越期待去向大家介绍了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a272489b251902b7b77bd1ca65879bbdb3e32591d91dddbfe8af8eefaab43c64",
      "text": "正是因为有这样温柔的内核，我们才挑选了\n《With...STORY》这首歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c79a478580ca205e508e008612fc97e3e23b903ef69b7e6ac42ae2395a4b626",
      "text": "请务必借助各位的力量，把“合作游玩”的魅力\n传递给广大玩家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000115:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2830035896391350e9ffec508480fcebfa2c9e84b8a03af38c73713e2ce0e35",
      "text": "…辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天的对台本，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13503a5063a900bf97166febbbbcf240ee30be272cb873de7bac9cf6168ee648",
      "text": "…这次的工作，感觉也很有趣呢。\n现在就已经很期待拍摄了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a06a2cf6c85879d33b4a45abd14c97d64b5fb2148da6274bebb21779eb4ceff",
      "text": "…说起来接下来的休息日，\n我们三个人约好一起去游戏厅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de7fe7be8f18a6c59a4be4d317b026dc533bafd6d1bbcbba300c5e7e77b2354a",
      "text": "…虽然要宣传的游戏还没正式上线，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000131:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9dfc7b2d50d1d083a39d1c2d728aa8f8f273af9334baa5cd1f928f3a0075b38",
      "text": "但大吾提议说，去体验一下其他各种各样的\n音乐游戏也能当做一种学习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5cb8d5832318d9b05ecaedbb5b0ac1c8e5ff5be78355433509e460a2055aaf",
      "text": "…凉似乎也对音乐游戏不太熟悉，\n所以两个人特别起劲呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000135:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6524c60f72a5942d541a56f150d34d5205d78547f19975fdb7ea149af5273486",
      "text": "好好享受吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000138:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80da37fd1daa8820221247b611b8d0bf5ac3df84dc7e7f015951042947b3557a",
      "text": "…嗯。谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000140:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac109625b60b4fb0ac55b5348715cddb011573b7de1982fd7f74c188b54a29dd",
      "text": "…为了在拍摄时不出差错，\n我们三个人会去好好学习一番的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b6b2c6de4671b77033f55afedad7e247fa285283beb948d08b24e9e27c62ebc",
      "text": "…下次见面时，再跟你聊聊感想吧。\n那么回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:449ebbd4a2268dd348a349ed23efe388f53d7dc5e6f06028449c8df90348c899",
      "text": "这一片就是音游区了吧。\n你们两个，有感兴趣的游戏吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3e4a1a6e914649827ed012a8d62aab08a1fcbca671bef5befb1dceeb1c2e8a",
      "text": "…为了学习，本来打算把各种类型都体验一遍的，\n但是种类太丰富了……一时不知该选哪个好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c906ebc1adf4df413f832e45f3cc7b937fee9cdda06e6241bb0f58e3f664c7bd",
      "text": "…今天一天想把所有的都玩过来，恐怕不太可能。\n果然机台数量多的那些，才是人气款吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:443d4739f2204d3cc58dd4697a14365ecb33d4ce1bd9d1480b4a2acbab25b4f4",
      "text": "排得这么整整齐齐的，确实让人眼花缭乱呢。\n……啊，这个游戏我在视频里看到过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac8265dbc1e9fa1b265c69dda0c813a5a43f555e161758a9235bc3431800f3f0",
      "text": "喔，是吗！这个看起来是双人对战形式的呢。\n最开始就先玩这个试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:235e943940836696af2d58f1522cdc84c5668986a320dbb17201f296ad342bee",
      "text": "嗯！不过，我还是第一次玩呢。\n不知道能不能玩得好……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8046ba5834e061d4fd9205726086be7f8e462dad0e374e31d1b7387e1eae423",
      "text": "总之先玩得开心就好！\n那么凉，对战请多指教啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdc5dfc81657bbd0810e68aea10160b13495cf4b27596143125c2aff2724a94e",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊！输掉了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3a22fa61878f1311089007968a40f126217c29dcf6c8d927a291819dc6d8b9c",
      "text": "哇哈哈！这个音游只要连击不断，\n好像就能拿高分的样子呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_c:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0317cc884f4c078413dd47d44d741b00aa7e585ce5e90074ce466ebc2d7f00",
      "text": "这一点跟格斗游戏挺像的嘛。\n那么接下来，换老师和凉试试看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08aa9fce46dd337334718e3ebe0c86faeb3a0275967783e9b914cb10047dd24d",
      "text": "一希先生，有想玩的曲子吗？\n我选哪首都可以哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49ce7366db9db4fe4de88f43d8d1d92fa0fb101b833b7e8a2b3f6bd7e19bb8fc",
      "text": "…既然如此，选这首可以吗？\n我听过几次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead6939326aa33d823130465fa60cd74d4daae76158aff6ef7dd70edf51320d5",
      "text": "当然没问题！好～嘞，为了拿到比刚才\n更好的分数，加油咯～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b00f1bd063647c4b7fe824f1e02c54122e3fc03b69e35b16b2c87804aaf726e1",
      "text": "两个人就差一点点了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce34045c710919b903fbf116b8e1142102927946e7912b6f597d0fd2287f6590",
      "text": "…分数达不到规定值的话，就会失败啊。\n抱歉，凉。看来是我挑的曲子难度太高了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b79ee5f1e3a17a4ea979d644e16efba0a24883def50425102e07ada18fb7e95",
      "text": "没事的！\n确实很难，不过玩得很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a33d7833b20b0d0e80952b9270e7b4036984b0203bee3f98483a675d9c5b6a07",
      "text": "对了，我们再去试试别的游戏吧！\n那边那个看起来也挺好玩的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a70f1bc89ee7d2051b1272ffc5d52dd8b51317e958711eabbef6fa5e4560660c",
      "text": "…呵。\n嗯，说得也是。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374ecba319291b8632c5cd2d640ced619911e7e5fd683497f4bb2b0607ea8244",
      "text": "哎呀～玩得可真过瘾啊。\n你们俩今天感觉如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd6336dd8510d3f6fe51576938f329223981e5f1a89f65a89640000595682040",
      "text": "我以前从没在游戏厅主要玩音游，\n感觉特别新鲜，超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_d:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38c7e1a03fe6893d012900c58dd4cbcb3fbc5a6e809ce44c0f8f36b519f2ab53",
      "text": "不过大致体验过一圈后我觉得，\n对初学者来说稍微有点难的游戏还蛮多的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9872c86176b9e029d16067e50e48b4689c8103a8dc907d721cde4797008d6ef0",
      "text": "…确实，初见就能通关的游戏\n屈指可数呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfbf63b03ba2017eb21645f0f4574ffa3aaaf532fa747f0b1c7e4db0660bff3c",
      "text": "如果是对战形式的话，也会在意对手的发挥呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:338cf13fcce563e6a11788423cb2c65ba0c384e937ca78a6d9903422ea4971ef",
      "text": "难得跟朋友一起玩，\n还是能开开心心玩到最后的比较好啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ac322961ad0264ddb8a07fb9601a236d902201ea600732c309a3be89fe1068c",
      "text": "…嗯。而且在实际体验过游戏后，\n我还意识到了一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02b314af4561c5283b1d393efe173c894ccbeace70f5985134d25e9515d7af9e",
      "text": "…陈列在那里的每一款音乐游戏，\n在玩法和呈现方式上都有独一无二的特色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3abac1fa5c03e90419c65718e664f742fbaa941981d5d00d767b3bf54a45ec3f",
      "text": "…各自的个性，构成了它们的趣味所在。\n我们要宣传的游戏，其个性正是“合作游玩”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d0fc7f527d95b8778f714ec77777bbeab9911ab660073d87eb47b1a62da43c",
      "text": "正如老师说的那样啊。今天玩的这些里面，\n可没有通过合作来提高分数的音游呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53537a622b275b5074c477868943e69f09748965829a8978c0e432f19620f0f0",
      "text": "确实……！感觉重新体会到了\n我们要宣传的游戏的魅力所在呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1101bd5e4cec5091d761f397f5fb3820f9e49bc74c8a47380ddbb7b4e8f19e8c",
      "text": "俺也学到了不少。\n越来越期待宣传视频的拍摄了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c71b2dfd721d1eb780656c78cbeb0bb1ccbabb291ef7c61cc3477a1cf32e6ad6",
      "text": "我也超级期待的！正因为音游多到\n让人不知道玩哪款才好……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1a60773f44032a6d171e15bdae337c5911c52dfacc9cc4349838ae1580e5699",
      "text": "才更要向大家传达出那款游戏独有的魅力。\n那样一来，露出笑容的人肯定也会变多吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af4c3cff440821587a33ac693b82bdffe44170267c3050d4e833e70ab34ed46d",
      "text": "…嗯，正如你所说。我们要全力以赴，\n把“合作游玩”的魅力传递给每一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6358a38382a4254f1b4d9fa3a7c96b286779ba1f6d67a6d8740752dc6866ba7d",
      "text": "F-LAGS的各位，\n今天一整天，请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b920400ee6a4a2cd3286e166eee717e1cd308ce46ece2746e8449fc35a7dedf5",
      "text": "请多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc0c6677edb97dd77be851189e1d49b2c682bf18ece2a4449ff6ff7056106c33",
      "text": "那么事不宜迟，请允许我重新为各位\n说明一下今天的拍摄内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf299b0e7ddf95b78ac018463089924034617d3003bfcd95ff96373f58516bca",
      "text": "首先在前瞻环节，我们会拍摄各位\n游玩《With...STORY》时的画面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3c60bc9c259e968e79b1ef759e562d6d911052dd00eff446ce9e2b9b8b43156",
      "text": "后半部分则是会请各位逐一录制\n实际游玩过后的感想留言。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1da48b8a14abe90085ac212197fcd53851b7dc927fde9f46991c44c91d35d77b",
      "text": "明白了！\n拍摄中说的话，基本上是自由发挥对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a96dcd01403263d50024bce2ca70b528308d81d3dbe5bceb2d4b4e3bafea9df0",
      "text": "是的。虽然有简单的流程台本，\n但基本上畅所欲言就可以了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9b393495ba9f26e9017b491a1b429fef37a44421072e28655398c810b907907",
      "text": "…原来如此。也就是说，展现自然的状态就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:102a9598528f99d0ee6d919550f2a398e839e920c3ff6ea37d89ee61f7c7a4d9",
      "text": "哇哈哈！这样对俺们来说，\n反而更放得开呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51832bc1fefbb6f932ff61c50c23854ccf2f741533a96e0077e66391fa32ca95",
      "text": "就尽情去享受游戏，\n让大家拍下我们满分的笑容吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ca3bb7f3db04896228c366b5bd254df6359fe7bcf8530b2f4cbf575591d4efb",
      "text": "那么在拍摄之前，请先试玩一下吧。\n这台就是本次即将推出的游戏！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:155d471109fc34022582aa9ca6f2e869f28e205c41c9044a275f089f7f2e6454",
      "text": "哇，设计好帅气啊。\n……啊。你们两个，快听！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a27ddf5503b3306419e1d52bcc38bfb9458b9fb9c3ad3d518a6ed16d9d61b5e",
      "text": "嗯？……哦哦，正在放俺们的歌呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8484a1a5d7d821e066fb3506ad5748e91a6055033d49c350dc306a4cd5e09fa7",
      "text": "…像这样亲耳听到之后，切实地感受到了\n我们的歌曲真的被实装进去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:470b3ba33a4029248e0d73096ccd753b24f615c903c4548a10f25c8517678fce",
      "text": "试玩的时间已经留充足了，\n请尽情体验吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b46127727891f53d8775e0238bef64ae618a180329d3506102d689e22b5b9d0",
      "text": "……呼。顺利通关了呢，一希先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:004552586fdf6630bdb25795fa5df8f8dedb867e10467bf056beb4f4f03258af",
      "text": "…嗯。两个人的连击接续上之后，得分就\n涨上去了呢。这就是“合作游玩”的力量吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5173618a0fefbf87ca8a3b06499978088fd1f04b49f4d71a3eca7f224d074cf1",
      "text": "让我看看，凉和老师的得分是……\n喔，“S级”啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f99306660f04c5f1635a400d744b04ca6136b317a279a7c3e7a4755492906fa7",
      "text": "太棒了♪ 因为是我们自己的歌，\n点击音符的节奏很容易掌握呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1df035f13b8793b4a0f6c3ec6e935e9cacc81d6620f06a2ec47fad88b1818bd",
      "text": "下一个轮到俺了！刚才看着感觉，\n稍微把难度提高一点也没问题呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfced6e51e025c5bebfefea0e424cfd65c4003183aa44a0fac3d2a401747c317",
      "text": "既然这样难得有机会，\n要不要挑战一下最高难度看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_g:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:510613d302820adabd0b73fabb3a71e853a93bc0006e4e6f15ac6f90e1c84c85",
      "text": "嚯，最高难度吗……好，那就去挑战试试看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90e940a55dee37fab24492d586b3b78854d7faa0f0e19a39bc5692515bc4b818",
      "text": "……太好啦！\n刚才那把感觉相当不错呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a17924f9af640dcfee9b597328dc25efa0fd1adcf7af99a208fa5268e9236604",
      "text": "连击也啪啪啪全接上了呢。\n……“SS级”！？大吾君太厉害了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6abe66fd4905a37a3d8e1ef07ed7f215b39335dcf14b8eed2859a4220a7525f9",
      "text": "…真了不起。在最高难度的谱面下，\n居然能打出这么高的分数。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61d24836909f16423b3422a4bf861d36b4f941dd169bcc1ec21da4b4267714de",
      "text": "哇哈哈！看来今天状态极佳啊！\n保持这个势头，感觉能拿到更高的分数呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1697cf5a2f41145cd005026630854716c4902a88e1f9adc0eeaee27ef4d6a3d",
      "text": "……各位，拍摄马上就要开始了哦。\n大吾先生，正式录制也请保持这个状态加油！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000109:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b6fd93d031af51cd031e5eb9eaceb95f88771b273c1585a0aec5619ea1d2df5",
      "text": "游玩画面拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f85ce897793d16500d0f0c011e910cfb005f51cb33e88ce404a64a584c1d585",
      "text": "…剩下的就只有录制感想留言了。\n拍摄进行得很顺利，总算能松口气了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da45a7fdc77cea70753fdbe4468c2040dddb845128c57a0e3e51c85714c6989e",
      "text": "是啊。和一希先生一起“合作游玩”，在正式拍摄时\n也拿到了“S级”……啊，对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:525eeb8823ee82cbef3c80126dd3450f763e544f4422fa24e316f74d4256b645",
      "text": "我想稍微请教一下……这个\n“评级”，最高能达到多少级呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25f82a4369edf4134fcf316b2ea0c06de3b4f676376821d6823ae4153f957de9",
      "text": "最高有“SSS级”哦。\n不过难度可以说是相当高呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8dcf12406ed9eecde1fdadd20e42ce574f01fe9b8756df35f24061be5ccb28",
      "text": "哎！居然还有SSS吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_h:cmd-000175:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b49c8ee5cf462192f93a48853b963cd7d85780160a0ca3dbf89b6b974a27faf",
      "text": "原来不是到“SS级”就结束了啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85e35739f85e723b57c8a28ab40c000fc44f3601fc3235774be4e2fd96d74568",
      "text": "那个。我想稍微挑战一下\n那个最高的“SSS级”……可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4d0027c0938a09e5e5924846dfbc71444bea1fe80c8e34d0f2eeef03428741d",
      "text": "当然可以！时间还有充裕，\n只要F-LAGS的各位觉得没问题，请务必试试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfcc721b88372b090e3062252fda09636dd477d167c98b5a0ac34a45628590e0",
      "text": "我们这边的日程也没有问题。\n机会难得，请务必去挑战一下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15c20f9a5076d6558a30757c19c06fffec0222f1a63dca8a2e70fb7012425ed2",
      "text": "既然这样，那一段能让我们也拍下来吗？\n很希望能记录下各位挑战最高分的身姿！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d50e6ac3779c3672d4bc7ffac90372f343b6bb107b29ad892acca815f7bfc235",
      "text": "那么，就来打加时赛吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b018dfbd7ddd95ddd557becd16eb70f0f7dba02752329befa20c233e80e0711a",
      "text": "……不行啊！又停在“SS级”了！\n最高评级的门槛果然很高啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a10d05b7bdc1f299513d82f6f827d8d2d6c7c7e34a729559aa1847bb2c3d4408",
      "text": "…连击虽然接得很长，但还是差了一点吗。\n不愧是最高评级啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9645380c6e1f621dfe9819de41c9473ca3e319010703d1005079ad19dec44494",
      "text": "但是，每次挑战都在刷新最高分记录……\n照这个势头感觉能行哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8743bc4a95e5e90d7cbcd024b7b3c9a7a829b4c281b07b0e1eaaa311e82f040",
      "text": "…嗯。换做大吾的话，一定能达到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb675b1517ccdf2714a39b323335df997d85532ff32368d83e255f1a3037232a",
      "text": "大吾先生。我们也会为你加油的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c4649745dff88585a4d2aca6d7d41c55fd37a488418bc635693c47d5423471",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●老板……\n还有凉和老师，谢谢你们！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fac4e71f1261ab8bd546e8b06768310e6d04e0248703d627cbb3bf2d35b9aa4c",
      "text": "大家的加油声，真的给了我莫大的底气啊。\n虽然是一个人在操作，但感觉并不是孤身一人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac09ccf775c6a378cbbeb02882048b05d7c69d5a46d640bc37e644cb9e1dd6e4",
      "text": "简直就跟这款游戏的概念一模一样啊。\n用“合作游玩”把连击接续下去……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_i:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11c7fa2e8ca165bf7b84e9505989c5dd8d95e375903d51850708d69a745ba142",
      "text": "啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a0ba3f7ed14cf5e86149b302ba8b2a80d55fcf576bec1fbc6be09ff3bdded20",
      "text": "对啊！现在正是展现\n“合作游玩”的时候啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:033857e61af92b551be234de9d9601786b417643ded01f0654d185dd10467434",
      "text": "…嗯。大吾的背后还有我们在。\n一起以“SSS级”为目标吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7e8a471d364b7b86be8697fb61a41b26c73bcdf4f9e008b74e75e703a17d0d6",
      "text": "噢！只要俺们齐心协力，一定没问题的！\n老师，背后就交给你了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb480817d850e52fff16c7f374293db132a014839a961a5a5aa63d4a0b00cf8f",
      "text": "……啊，分数出来了！结果是……\n太好啦——！居然是“SSS级”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77c264b2a45657e42d29b3cd4fd553d3fe06e733c92b50077c7046740ed42a76",
      "text": "…辛苦了，大吾。\n总算是达成目标了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7f4b2daaee79950e04097ab55bbf8afd8da1a70a6d8f4268efd74bf713db3c1",
      "text": "噢！老师，也谢谢你的配合！能拿到\n最高评级固然很高兴……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7832c4c34c2a90247a5866e7b36e1c17eaeda96b984d2772d86406b7e9fda1df",
      "text": "但最让人开心的，莫过于这是和大家\n齐心协力达成的结果了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42c4000af5d65c85f5dfbbe4e0e526a5b12f1ffe0af0faeaae20174bf0813333",
      "text": "真不愧是F-LAGS的各位呢。大家齐心协力克服\n难关的身姿……在旁边看着真的很令人感动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270956c000aee27e45af2c143736717987b394f5d059a94be00f9f726122ee56",
      "text": "是啊。拍到了非常棒的画面哦！\n这样一来，游玩画面的拍摄就完全搞定了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000171:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e",
      "text": "然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee418ada39ca65c0241e60c91ad9ff447891b49c3661395a2f339fb012ca0f6f",
      "text": "这个游戏的魅力，就在于大人和孩子能一起乐在其中！\n请大家务必一起试玩看看哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71e9d98f15d61dfafa925f449d7abbad2f09d8fd965b446490e1922714c5a9e7",
      "text": "…收录的曲目也很丰富。如果选曲拿不定主意，\n请试着玩玩我们的歌曲吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcd9e028ab09f5f854d5c6dfd19039d12271a16e3855dfc9148cd52407abc5ab",
      "text": "还有……虽然一个人也能玩得很开心，\n但和同伴一起合作挑战高难度也很有趣哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000222:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aea986e6d49a237f4393fe51ac22aa5db237cda9801dcf1e9b62c8d02d8691b9",
      "text": "就算一个人跨不过去的困难，\n只要和同伴在一起就一定能战胜。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000251:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d735ab3cb489039507095aff600ca7ce71096d5e380ec6524e65ad53641760",
      "text": "就像俺们拿到最高评级一样！哇哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000267:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000274:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18dd73c8ee57062955a72e43518e6b84231d805bffa16f08f632f8556af6ef2b",
      "text": "我刚才去了一趟\n游戏厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000276:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4394d7b148cab7bcf5a284fb5c39bf239ab5151bb9431fdb25e7e2bb0b7b7d22",
      "text": "俺们前阵子\n拍摄的PV，\n店里正在播呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000278:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76d5632edf5acfed6290e8a25d9ef1d9f5a1704538ecb411ea8fb5915acd6b75",
      "text": "说起来那款音游，\n今天正式上线了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000280:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856c219717fa7292b0a74b638a9396145181768e90dfc715e00f59fd93609560",
      "text": "是这样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000280:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50f7b39f0b3ae6fb89783c74cfd37c0258e4fcdcec1e3790d9857e960b6c82ac",
      "text": "是这样呢！总觉得才刚拍完\n没多久，\n真是一转眼就到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000283:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:432d2948e1d6a83f33ec90d7d3700dc5964b278a59f68fd9a7ee6f1c3fd177e6",
      "text": "嗯。为了学习而前往游戏厅的事，\n感觉就像发生在昨天一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000285:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e77a904de483ed2155fe121c565bd4cc4757b4d0178dc5908cf7ef38323d89",
      "text": "拍摄的时候也很开心呢。\n大家齐心协力\n以最高评级为目标……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000287:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:451a33f5884f534bd7f2bcc3f8eda6f79f0ca4b188304e97a101f9c93bb5c960",
      "text": "不知道为什么，像这样聊着聊着，\n又想和大家一起去游戏厅了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000289:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b476584c2fb706e3295d97fca0f01c28c0656e1534f27f32583386034c5fe86d",
      "text": "啊，我也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000291:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b60f204ca764b62811747d5fc875e8f8a9fa50d2bdff351af7a542a716124f0",
      "text": "那就难得有机会！\n要是大家都有空，不如现在就\n一起去看看怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_j:cmd-000293:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52450d46575199cc37f87531014be4749c466ddc3491770b531a91958cf80bd",
      "text": "我也赞成。待会儿\n在游戏厅集合吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d8b2b733332308a31cfa8564c2a91583181b5232eff6e91b39d01c6ef58ed6c",
      "text": "…相当热闹呢。\n在玩的人看起来表情都非常开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e86b3d031256eba2383d444d693eeda3ad49e4779492cf31f9fbe3af42d499c",
      "text": "…宣传力度很大啊。\n没想到游戏厅里也在循环播放着PV。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a0477d2456ab4a4ef359e31f291739ab90e2b08ab68ea46e01e3babe89d1e6a",
      "text": "是啊！据说这个PV大受好评，\n大家都说“拍得太棒了”……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:636e762515aa07b1900ff8738967571f3e4f0c742639aa2219bd70cd3e8a2e17",
      "text": "我也非常喜欢这个PV哦！\n尤其是大吾君认真的神情特别令人印象深刻。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43046056137a9198a9e81779b8fa11414d697d1c2d05e963fc9b17b8270c60a6",
      "text": "哈哈。谢谢你，凉！\n确实，连我自己都觉得拍出了很棒的PV呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b59689859b06e0751a91c382c59751748e843e4e46ca4406a217bc8a21bd1d52",
      "text": "不过……一想到以后每次来游戏厅\n都会看到这段影像，就稍微有点难为情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20c56d1ec1922e0b2d35574ff4f1f17e63635a1fbd8aee17b1844bef60d5511c",
      "text": "…呵。看着打出最高评级由衷高兴的大吾，\n不知不觉间自己也会想去玩玩这款游戏呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab82b7dbf32179897b7528d48644bf720359e77bc275f737256b02f97796031",
      "text": "呵呵。\n那我们也去机台前排队吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:364d021bebe3fe2c408144546d755ffc7e6e009de7a23d83118bd21b2b538b36",
      "text": "噢！\n今天也要三人一起大显身手，来场合作游玩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01dfbf0b9b426403d7e3c47d2de07ddc85c0a0a0b965e56d5cc1b02ef261ac69",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_k:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:742a1e9a054f71d9e518f8bc39eb0983fbf4031219b9e77e9c861370cb012587",
      "text": "好，今天也要三个人一起拿下SSS！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
